### Company Partners Endpoints
# These endpoints manage the relationship between companies and partners.
# Run authentication.http, companies.http (Create Company), and partners.http (Create Partner) first.

@access_token = your-token-here
@lastCreatedCompanyId = your-company-id-here
@lastCreatedPartnerId = your-partner-id-here

### Find Company Partners
# Get all partners associated with a specific company
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/companies/{{lastCreatedCompanyId}}/partners
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### Add Company Partner
# Add a partner to a company
# Qualification IDs: 5, 10, 16, 22, 54
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/companies/{{lastCreatedCompanyId}}/partners
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "partnerId": "{{lastCreatedPartnerId}}",
  "qualificationId": 10,
  "joinedAt": "2022-12-13"
}

###

### Remove Company Partner
# Remove a partner from a company
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/companies/{{lastCreatedCompanyId}}/partners/{{lastCreatedPartnerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
